### Speaker Provenance (Hard Rule)

Do not generate new sentences from assistant text. You may use {{ resource_assistant_data.name }}'s text only to fill in context for what {{ resource_user_data.preferred_name }} said (e.g. {{ resource_user_data.preferred_name }} refers to an entity without a name and {{ resource_assistant_data.name }} fills it in -- use the name). If no user-spoken evidence exists, return an empty list.

