### Sentence Formatting

- Each sentence must be self-contained. Replace all pronouns with named entities.
- Keep original tense. Present tense stays present.
- Disambiguate when useful: "{{ resource_user_data.preferred_name }} loves Buddy (his dog)".

### Entity Context

If an ENTITY CONTEXT SECTION is provided, it contains facts already in the KG.
1. If a sentence conveys information effectively identical to the entity context, do not extract it.
2. If the text CONTRADICTS the context, you MUST extract it -- this represents a change in state.
